<title>USA: Austin's Int'l names Graybill president.</title>
<headline>Austin's Int'l names Graybill president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austin's International Inc said it named Larry Graybill as president to replace Elie Sopas, the company's president and chief operating officer, who resigned to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>Graybill has been with the company since 1990, serving mainly as chief financial officer, a position he will continue to hold, he told Reuters.</p>
<p>He added that the position of COO &quot;will remain open for now.&quot;</p>
<p>Austin's said Sopas will pursue other opportunities in his native South Africa.</p>
</text>
